The full pipeline is depicted in Fig.~\ref{fig} and formalized in Algorithm~\ref{alg}. After identifying the optimal parameter tuple $\theta^$, the system retrains the LSTM on features regenerated with $\theta^$. This process enhances performance under diverse traffic conditions while preserving interpretability. By tuning the feature extraction layer and coupling it with a compact LSTM, our framework improves generalization, reduces overfitting, and enables accurate detection of persistent congestion behavior.

